 "said": {
  "text": "Watch live = HOT RENDER. A Watch live link on every approval row (details) and every running build in the Build manager / Build orchestrator pops up (floating window desktop, full-screen sheet phone) the exact screen the session is changing, changed element scrolled to + outlined, hot-rendering as files change. Every web app, every hot-swappable asset (no reload), Android screens through the web port with a next-APK note. claude-headless.sh starts previews + registry; console proxies /preview/<session>/<app>/ behind auth; axf focus + .axf-focus.json; greyed No live preview otherwise.",
